{
    "_meta": "Per-leader voice mapping for DowagerMod Chatter voiceover. v6: prosody + native-tongue + accent. Map values may be a bare voice name string OR a {voice, rate, pitch, lang, locale, accent} object. rate/pitch examples: '-15%' / '+10%'. lang = human-readable language name (e.g. 'Russian', 'Mongolian'); when set AND DOWAGER_CHATTER_NATIVE_TONGUE_MODE=true, the LLM generates a translation that the TTS speaks instead of English. Leaders without 'lang' stay English even in native mode. accent = the accent the leader would have speaking English (e.g. 'French', 'German'); when set, the LLM rewrites lines in TTS-friendly accented English so the voice synthesizer produces convincingly accented speech. Leaders without 'accent' (native English speakers) speak standard English.",
    "_native_tongue_meta": "When DOWAGER_CHATTER_NATIVE_TONGUE_MODE=true, the LLM also generates a 'line_native' translation for each line in the speaker's actual language. The TTS speaks the native version; in-game text shows English (subtitles). Leaders without a 'lang' field below stay English-only even in native-tongue mode (English natives, ambiguous historical languages, or where translation quality is doubtful). The 'lang' value is the human-readable language name passed to the LLM in its prompt.",
    "_fallback_male": [
        "en-US-DavisNeural",
        "en-CA-LiamNeural",
        "en-GB-ThomasNeural",
        "en-AU-WilliamNeural"
    ],
    "_fallback_female": [
